(
    title: "Gangster Alley",
    description: Some("Outlaws pop from the windows and rooftop of a building down the alley, and you swing a gunsight across the scene to pick them off before they draw on you. Ammunition is limited, and every hit you take strips away one of your bulletproof vests; the rooftop bomber must be dropped the instant he raises a grenade or it is game over at once."),
